--------------------Here are the assert statements related to the comments:

```cs
Debug.Assert(RET >= OLD(Count) - 1); 
// Value of Count increases by 1 when a new item is added
Debug.Assert(RET >= OLD(Count)); 
// Value of Count remains the same when an existing item is being added
Debug.Assert(RET > OLD(Count) || RET < OLD(Count) + 1); 
// Value of Count always increases by at least 1 or remains the same
```

Here, `OLD(variable_name)` refers to the value of `variable_name` at the beginning of the function or method, and `RET` refers to the return value of the function or method.
